Selected Idea
-------------

Control Narrative first - Narrative is the most recurrent visible locus of companyproduct hierarchy drift
Across experiments 007-009 the earliest observable stage that departs from the requested company-first introduction is most often Narrative. Treating Narrative as the primary control point (not just Idea or Compose) is the strongest editorial lever for preserving a company-first story.

